        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Robin, Christopher Robin Milne, A. A. Milne, Brady Bluhm, Brandon Bluhm\n- Products: Winnie-the-Pooh, Return to the Hundred Acre Wood, Winnie the Pooh films\n- Concepts: fictional characters, anthropomorphic teddy bears\n\nFacts:\n- Winnie-the-Pooh is a fictional anthropomorphic teddy bear created by English author A. A. Milne.\n- Christopher Robin appears in A. A. Milne's popular books of poetry and Winnie-the-Pooh stories.\n- Christopher Robin is named after Christopher Robin Milne, who was A. A. Milne's son.\n- Brady Bluhm is best known for playing Christopher Robin in many Winnie the Pooh films.\n- Brady Bluhm is the brother of actor Brandon Bluhm.\n- Return to the Hundred Acre Wood is a Winnie-the-Pooh novel that was published on 5 October 2009.",
